&_nc_oc=Adp5AMwTl2InlJQdTgDf6Y9S4n3nlpW58RP5kaKnP7fj7bJ80qTuFkTccVB-n5USvL4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSM253k1pnrGHk7u8BswXXrTFr1WBCVjsyz0w1701hnPw&oe=6AEA078F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "nomad_shooter_exact_2560x1440_24bit.png", "id": "1650210489964847", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823279_1650210496631513_7793386767145659260_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=IHsnE2QQnxwQ7kNvwF6xIDS&_nc_oc=AdqJNviCU832bWqc5MQEMyc4N7TScSavXMz9Avf5Fug6JFXVnxeLHw_WWYbD8hFv5ZU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQi0WXm135T4BjCM8abCzhoUFVtKfVx0uAFwFxosBpbbw&oe=6AEA1127"}, "display_name": "Nomad Shooter", "keywords": ["archery", "bow", "sport", "arcade", "training"], "long_description": "# Nomad Shooter\n\nA VR archery challenge that rewards a steady hand, a clean release, and the satisfaction of a true shot. Step into the role of a steppe archer and put your skill to the test.\n\n**Earn Every Shot**\n\nThere are no shortcuts to the next trial. Earn the score you need to advance, learn from every miss, and come back with better timing and a steadier hand. The further you go, the more each shot demands: judgment, patience, and the nerve to release at the right moment.\n\n**Master the Bow**\n\nTrain at your own pace or go for a cleaner run. A master archer guides you, but only you can make the shot.\n\n**Breathe. Draw. Release.**", "short_description": "Draw the bow, make a clean release, and watch your arrow fly true. In Nomad Shooter, you become a steppe archer, training at your own pace and facing trials that demand greater focus with every shot."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://crocos.kz/politika-konfidenczialnosti-nomad-shooter", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "CROCOS GAMES", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://crocos.kz/", "category": null, "comf